      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Your last stone decides what happens next. There are three endings.\n\n1.
    It lands in an EMPTY pit \u2014 your turn is over.\n\n2. It lands in a pit that
    already had stones, on your OUTER row \u2014 lift that whole pit and carry on
    sowing.\n\n3. It lands in a pit that already had stones, on your INNER row \u2014
    look straight across at the two enemy pits in that column. If both have stones,
    you CAPTURE them all. If either is empty, you just lift and carry on sowing."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1ce794294464a1e42b1f0e4e99829d6f, type: 2}
