      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Your turn keeps rolling until a stone finally lands in an empty pit. A
    single tap can run for a long time.\n\nYou win when your opponent cannot move
    at all \u2014 when they have no pit left holding 2 or more stones.\n\nSo capturing
    is not the point by itself. The point is to leave them with nothing they are
    allowed to play."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1ce794294464a1e42b1f0e4e99829d6f, type: 2}
