  m_text: 'Tap one of your pits and you lift every stone out of it.


    Those stones
    then drop one at a time into the pits that follow, moving anti-clockwise around
    your own two rows.


    You can only lift a pit holding 2 or more stones. That
    is the only restriction on what you may play.'
