      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Captured stones do not go into a store. You put them straight back to
    work on your own side.\n\nThey start dropping from the pit just after the one
    you FIRST lifted this turn \u2014 not from where the capture happened. That is
    why one capture can set off a very long chain.\n\nThe pit you landed in keeps
    its own stones. You only take the two enemy pits."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
