  m_text: 'Before the game starts, you place your own 32 stones across your 16 pits
    however you like.


    Tap a pit to add a stone. Tap it again to take one back.
    Press START when you are happy.


    One thing to know: a pit needs at least
    2 stones before you are allowed to play it. Any pit you leave holding a single
    stone is dead until something lands in it.'
