      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Four rows of eight pits.


    The bottom two rows are yours. The top
    two are your opponent''s.


    Of your two rows, the one nearer the middle is
    your INNER row. That is the only row that can capture, so it is the one to watch.


    Your
    stones never leave your two rows. You are not trying to reach their side.'
